# PsionNet -- MS-CHAP credentials for Windows CE devices.
#
# Windows prefers MS-CHAPv2, and MPPE encryption keys are DERIVED from the
# MS-CHAP exchange -- so a link authenticated with PAP can never be encrypted.
# If the device's connection requires data encryption, PAP cannot satisfy it
# no matter what else is configured.
#
# Enter these on the device as the connection's username and password.
#
# client    server  secret      IP addresses
psion       *       psion       10.0.2.2
*           psion   psion       10.0.2.2
